    "description": "### Impact\nPrevent stored XSS in chat transcripts by using safe DOM APIs to render usernames in the rich text editor. The editor now uses `textContent` instead of `innerHTML` for transcript headers, ensuring that any markup provided in quote metadata is rendered as literal text.\n\n### Patches\nUpgrade to the patched version.\n\n### Workarounds\nUpgrade to the patched version.",
